{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11208240","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11208240","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120824001:1":{"text":"물건은 가져오셨습니까?","source_cn":"您要提交悬赏物吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4F93ABE92E338B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1120824001":{"text":"물건은 가져오셨습니까?","source_cn":"您要提交悬赏物吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE4F93ABE92E338B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120824002:1":{"text":"먼저 물건을 확인해 볼게요.","source_cn":"标的物已收到，请待我查验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8BF72B1B4AD303EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:6:1120824003:0":{"text":"확인 중…","source_cn":"正在检查","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9042664EADBA1B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120824004:1":{"text":"…확실히 크림슨 고원의 거미독이군요. 문제없습니다.","source_cn":"……检验无误。您确实取回了深红高原的诡蛛毒液。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46540E9FE57CD32E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120824005:1":{"text":"저, 정말 통과했어!","source_cn":"竟、竟然真的通过了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x414B1532A17A6962","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120824006:1":{"text":"그럼 두 번째 의뢰는…","source_cn":"那么，第二个悬赏要求是——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBAF21E8592415EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120824007:1":{"text":"…잠깐만, 집사 영감! 뱀… 흠, 거미독을 줬잖아! 두 번째라니?","source_cn":"——等等，执事老爷！之前的悬赏条件都满足了，怎么还有下...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C41D2065F0489E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120824008:1":{"text":"파이크 경께서 세 번의 시험을 통과한 사람에게만 석양의 눈을 내어주겠다고 하셨습니다.","source_cn":"荒矛老爷的要求如此。等三项考验达成后，才能将残阳之眼给各位。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC2A592DE973158F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120824009:1":{"text":"…이봐 집사 영감, 그 전에 보상으로 걸린 석양의 눈을 먼저 우리한테 보여줘.","source_cn":"……我说执事老爷，既然真有残阳之眼那种好东西，就先给我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x153BDA980E7CB4CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120824010:1":{"text":"보여준다고 파이크 경이 정한 규정에 어긋나는 것도 아니고, 실물을 보여줘야 우리도 의욕이 생길 거 아니야! 보여주지도 않고 세 번의 의뢰를 마치라면, 누가 믿겠어?","source_cn":"看看又没有违背荒矛老爷的规定，而且还能让接悬赏的人更有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x85B2A5484943176B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120824011:0":{"text":"그렇다면… 자, 이게 석양의 눈입니다.","source_cn":"……既然如此，请看。这就是残阳之眼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBF0D529F26D6A4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:15::0":{"text":"석양의 눈","source_cn":"残阳之眼","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CF0B19E03F50B0A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120824012:1":{"text":"정말 예쁜 루비네요!","source_cn":"好美丽的红宝石……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A10B45EC16E3937","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120824013:0":{"text":"…이 투명함과 색깔… 확실히 석양의 눈이 맞군…","source_cn":"……这种通透度和火彩，确实是残阳之眼没错啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CD6453EFEDEB7F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120824014:0":{"text":"<male>마법사</male><female>마법사</female>, 이 의뢰는 무조건 해야 해. 이건 천재일우의 기회란 말이야.","source_cn":"<male>老爷</male><female>小姐</...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF34A47C97BA93A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":